    {
      "id": 31,
      "plugin": "Core",
      "model": "Notes",
      "version": "2.6.6",
      "params": [],
      "pos": [
        80,
        4
      ],
      "data": {
        "text": "Everything new in 2.3.0, one row each, top to bottom.\n1. Picture to CV: a moving picture goes into the Video Probe. A slow LFO moves the probe across it, and its LUMA output sets the pitch of the bars on the second oscillator, so the bars bunch and spread as the probe moves.\n2. A loop through a Frame Delay: a shape is cabled round a loop and leaves a spiralling trail.\n3. One Video Oscillator bends another through FM IN.\n4. Scan Processor LIFT IN: the oscillator's picture is drawn as lines, and the moving shape on LIFT IN lifts them.\n5. Feedback with Fade trails fully to black: a small dot leaves a trail that fades out completely.\nEach row ends in its own Display."
      }
    }
  ],
